  "content": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "about",
        "slug": "about",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Weddings planned with calm and care.",
          "eyebrow": "About",
          "intro": "Evermore is a small wedding planning studio working around Lake Cesano, the Tuscan hills and wherever else a couple would like to be married.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k38",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We started Evermore because we believe a wedding should feel like the two of you, not like a template. Our work is quiet, thorough and unhurried, and we take on a limited number of weddings each year so that every couple gets our full attention.",
                  "_key": "k38s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k39",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Most of our weddings take place outdoors, on terraces, in gardens and beside water, with a lot of flowers and a lot of light. Whether the celebration is for twelve guests or a hundred and twenty, the approach is the same: understand what matters, build a plan that holds, and then take care of the details.",
                  "_key": "k39s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k40",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "How we work",
                  "_key": "k40s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k41",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We begin with a conversation, not a form. We learn about you, your families and the day you imagine, then propose a concept, a budget and a plan. From there we handle suppliers, timelines and guest details, and stay beside you right through to the last dance.",
                  "_key": "k41s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k42",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We answer every message personally, usually within two working days.",
                  "_key": "k42s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k43",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Where we work",
                  "_key": "k43s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k44",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Our home region is northern Italy, around the lakes and the hills of Tuscany and Umbria. We also plan destination weddings further afield and bring our own team with us.",
                  "_key": "k44s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "planning-terms",
        "slug": "planning-terms",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Planning terms",
          "eyebrow": "Good to know",
          "intro": "A few things that help every wedding run smoothly.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k45",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Booking",
                  "_key": "k45s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k46",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "An inquiry is not a booking. We reply by email, talk through your plans and, if we are a good fit, confirm with a short written agreement and a deposit.",
                  "_key": "k46s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k47",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Payments",
                  "_key": "k47s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k48",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Planning fees are paid in instalments, with the balance due before the wedding. Supplier payments are made by you directly unless we have agreed otherwise in writing.",
                  "_key": "k48s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k49",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Changes and postponements",
                  "_key": "k49s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k50",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Plans change. If you need to move your date, tell us as early as you can and we will do everything possible to protect your suppliers and deposits.",
                  "_key": "k50s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "services": [
      {
        "id": "full-planning",
        "slug": "full-planning",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Full Planning",
          "summary": "Everything from the first conversation to the last dance, so you can simply be there.",
          "best_for": "Couples who want one calm partner for the whole journey",
          "price_label": "From $9,500",
          "includes": "Design concept and mood board\nVenue search and site visits\nVendor selection and contracts\nBudget and timeline management\nGuest experience and accommodation planning\nRehearsal and full wedding-day direction",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 10,
          "photo": "/images/arch-lakeside.webp",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k1",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Full planning is the way most of our couples work with us. We begin with a long, unhurried conversation about what you want the day to feel like, then turn that into a concept, a budget and a plan you can see.",
                  "_key": "k1s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k2",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "How it works",
                  "_key": "k2s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k3",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We find the venue, introduce you to florists, caterers, musicians and photographers we trust, negotiate the contracts, and keep every date and payment in one shared timeline. You make the decisions that matter; we handle everything that follows from them.",
                  "_key": "k3s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k4",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "On the day itself we run the schedule, brief every supplier and stay close to you and your families, so nothing needs your attention except the moment in front of you.",
                  "_key": "k4s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "partial-planning",
        "slug": "partial-planning",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Partial Planning",
          "summary": "Expert guidance and structure for couples who have started and want a steady hand for the rest.",
          "best_for": "Couples who have a venue or a few suppliers already",
          "price_label": "From $4,800",
          "includes": "Planning review and priority list\nBudget and timeline reset\nUp to six supplier introductions\nDesign direction for décor and flowers\nMonthly planning calls\nWedding-day coordination",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 20,
          "photo": "/images/chairs-blooms.webp",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k5",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Partial planning suits couples who have already made some big choices and want help with the rest. We begin by reviewing what is booked, what is missing and where the plan feels shaky.",
                  "_key": "k5s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k6",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Where we step in",
                  "_key": "k6s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k7",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Together we agree which parts you would like us to take on: design, supplier introductions, the order of the day or the final month. We keep the scope clear so you know exactly what you are getting.",
                  "_key": "k7s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "day-of-coordination",
        "slug": "day-of-coordination",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Day-of Coordination",
          "summary": "A calm, experienced team who take over the plan you have made and run the day.",
          "best_for": "Couples who have planned it all and want to be guests at their own wedding",
          "price_label": "From $2,200",
          "includes": "Two planning check-ins in the final two months\nSupplier confirmation and arrival schedule\nWedding-day timeline and run sheet\nRehearsal direction\nTeam of two on the day, up to 10 hours\nPack-down and return of hired items",
          "featured": false,
          "position": 30,
          "photo": "/images/aisle-lanterns.webp",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k8",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "You have done the planning. We make sure it happens exactly as you imagined. Starting about two months before the wedding, we review every detail, speak to every supplier and build a run sheet that everyone can follow.",
                  "_key": "k8s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k9",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "On the day",
                  "_key": "k9s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k10",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We arrive before anyone else and leave after everyone else. We set up, cue the ceremony, manage the timeline, solve the small problems quietly and keep you free to enjoy the day.",
                  "_key": "k10s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "destination-weddings",
        "slug": "destination-weddings",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Destination Weddings",
          "summary": "Celebrations in the places that matter to you, planned with local knowledge and a travelling team.",
          "best_for": "Couples marrying away from home, with guests travelling in",
          "price_label": "On request",
          "includes": "Location scouting and venue shortlist\nLocal supplier network and contracts\nLegal and paperwork guidance\nGuest travel and welcome planning\nMulti-day schedule, from welcome drinks to farewell brunch\nOn-site team for the whole weekend",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 40,
          "photo": "/images/sunset-ceremony.webp",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k11",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "A destination wedding asks more of everyone, so we plan it as a whole weekend rather than a single day. We scout locations with you, build a trusted local team and look after your guests from the moment they book their flights.",
                  "_key": "k11s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k12",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Every proposal is bespoke",
                  "_key": "k12s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k13",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Because location, season, guest numbers and length of stay change everything, destination weddings are quoted individually. Tell us where you are dreaming of and we will reply with ideas and a proposal.",
                  "_key": "k13s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "weddings": [
      {
        "id": "marta-and-julien",
        "slug": "marta-and-julien",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Marta & Julien",
          "place": "Villa Serenella, Lake Cesano",
          "season": "Late September 2025",
          "style": "Lakeside garden",
          "guests": "84 guests",
          "summary": "A flower-arch ceremony on the stone terrace, with the whole lake as a backdrop.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 10,
          "photo": "/images/arch-lakeside.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/arch-lake.webp",
              "caption": "The terrace before the first guests arrived."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/chairs-blooms.webp",
              "caption": "Wild garden flowers along every row."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/approach-roses.webp",
              "caption": "Roses, tulle and the rings, ready for the ceremony."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/rings-card.webp",
              "caption": "A handwritten card for each place setting."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k14",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Marta and Julien wanted a day that felt generous but never grand. They chose Villa Serenella for its stone terrace above the water and asked for flowers that looked as if they had grown there.",
                  "_key": "k14s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k15",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We built the ceremony around a single arch of garden roses, white blooms and olive branches, and lined the aisle with loose, wild arrangements. Seating was arranged in a gentle curve so every guest could see the lake.",
                  "_key": "k15s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k16",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "What we planned",
                  "_key": "k16s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k17",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Venue search, design and florals, supplier contracts, guest accommodation for 60 visiting guests, a welcome aperitivo the evening before and full direction on the day.",
                  "_key": "k17s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "priya-and-daniel",
        "slug": "priya-and-daniel",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Priya & Daniel",
          "place": "Casa degli Ulivi, Tuscan hills",
          "season": "Early June 2025",
          "style": "Olive grove dinner",
          "guests": "60 guests",
          "summary": "A long table beneath old olive trees and an aisle lit by hundreds of candles.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 20,
          "photo": "/images/olive-terrace.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/aisle-lanterns.webp",
              "caption": "Lanterns lit along the aisle as the sun dropped."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/guest-book.webp",
              "caption": "The guest book table, with a ribbon from the bouquet."
